Power BI project placeholder for the retention dashboard.

This file is a placeholder because a .pbix file is a binary Power BI Desktop project file.
Use Power BI Desktop to create the final dashboard based on the SQL outputs and CSV data in this repository.

Recommended visuals:
- monthly revenue trend
- retention heatmap
- RFM segmentation chart
- repeat purchase rate donut chart
- cohort matrix
- top product list
